TI  - Novel vein closure procedure using a proprietary cyanoacrylate adhesive: 30-day swine model results
AU  - Robert J. Min
AU  - José I. Almeida
AU  - Derek J. McLean
AU  - Monte Madsen
AU  - Rodney Raabe
JO  - Phlebology The Journal of Venous Disease
