TI  - Endovenous laser ablation and foam sclerotherapy for varicose veins: does the presence of perforating vein insufficiency affect the treatment outcome?
AU  - Mert Köroğlu
AU  - Hüseyin Naim Eriş
AU  - Aykut Recep Aktaş
AU  - Mustafa Kayan
AU  - Ahmet Yeşildağ
AU  - Meltem Çetin
AU  - Cem Parlak
