TI  - Histopathologic differences in the endovenous laser ablation between jacketed and radial fibers, in an ex vivo dominant extrafascial tributary of the great saphenous vein in an in vitro model, using histology and immunohistochemistry
AU  - Henry F. Ashpitel
AU  - Emma B Dabbs
AU  - Francisco J. Salguero
