TI  - Prevalence and Patterns of Small Saphenous Vein Reflux
AU  - Diana L. Neuhardt
AU  - Sérgio X. Salles-Cunha
AU  - Nick Morrison
JO  - Journal for Vascular Ultrasound
PY  - 2009
VL  - 33
IS  - 1
