TI  - The impact of 2013 UK NICE guidelines on the management of varicose veins at the Heart of England NHS Foundation Trust, Birmingham, UK
AU  - Huw Davies
AU  - Matthew Popplewell
AU  - Gareth Bate
AU  - Lisa Kelly
AU  - Katy Darvall
AU  - Andrew W. Bradbury
JO  - Phlebology The Journal of Venous Disease
PY  - 2015
VL  - 31
