TI  - No Benefit of Wearing Compression Stockings after Endovenous Thermal Ablation of Varicose Veins: A Systematic Review and Meta-Analysis
AU  - Huanrui Hu
AU  - Jiarong Wang
AU  - Zhoupeng Wu
AU  - Yang Liu
AU  - Yukui Ma
AU  - Jichun Zhao
JO  - European Journal of Vascular and Endovascular Surgery
PY  - 2021
VL  - 63
IS  - 1
SP  - 103
