TI  - Comparative analysis of outcomes of radiofrequency ablation for incompetent great saphenous varicose vein using F-care (monopolar) and ClosureFast (segmental) systems and a method to improve outcomes in the monopolar system
AU  - Rahul Sima
AU  - Archana Rajan
AU  - Jithin Jagan Sebastian
AU  - N Sekar
JO  - Phlebology The Journal of Venous Disease
PY  - 2026
SP  - 2683555261428417
