TI  - Changes of stump length depending on starting position of glue injection related to venous diameter during cyanoacrylate closure for incompetent saphenous veins
AU  - Sungsin Cho
AU  - Jin Hyun Joh
JO  - Journal of Vascular Surgery Venous and Lymphatic Disorders
PY  - 2021
VL  - 10
