TI  - Cyanoacrylate adhesive closure in the European and American 2022 clinical practice guidelines
AU  - О. Shirinbek
JO  - Ambulatornaya khirurgiya = Ambulatory Surgery (Russia)
PY  - 2023
VL  - 20
IS  - 1
SP  - 38
