TI  - Phlebitis after cyanoacrylate obliteration: Modern state of the problem
AU  - A. I. Nadvikov
AU  - V. V. Kozlova
AU  - А. А. Фокин
AU  - А. В. Гасников
AU  - V. V. Chernousov
